title: ENDING_Start
tags:
---
<<SyncAffinity>>
<<set $talkedToZeusEnding = false>>
<<set $talkedToHermesEnding = false>>
<<set $talkedToHephaestusEnding = false>>
<<set $talkedToHestiaEnding = false>>

<<set $choseZeusEnding = false>>
<<set $choseHermesEnding = false>>
<<set $choseHephaestusEnding = false>>
<<set $choseHestiaEnding = false>>
//KITCHEN bg
<<Scene main_kitchen_bg_2>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" "right" "bottom" #e06666>>
<<PlayMusic Hestia_MainBody>>
Hestia: Good morning, Aelius! Glad to see that you could make it.
Hestia: I know it’s probably not exactly how you wanted to be reunited with your mother, but the other Olympians and I wanted to be here to support you.
<<if $zeusAffinity < 28 and $hermesAffinity < 29 and $hephaestusAffinity < 29>>
    Hestia: Hades said you can take me with you, as well.
<<else>>
    Hestia: Hades said you are only allotted <b>one person</b> with you, as well.
<<endif>>
Aelius: [Positive] Really? I’m… touched, honestly.
Aelius: [Positive] Everyone here is part of my family now, even if some of them would scoff at the idea.
Hestia: *<i>Laughs softly.</i>*
Hestia: Well, I best not delay you any longer. I’m sure you’ve been waiting far too long for this moment.
Aelius: [Positive] Thanks, Hestia. I know that none of this would’ve been possible if you hadn’t brought me here, so thank you. Thank you so much.
Hestia: Of course, now go see the others!

<<if $zeusAffinity < 28 and $hermesAffinity < 29 and $hephaestusAffinity < 29>>
    <<jump Ending_Hestia>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Ending_CompanionChoice>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ending_CompanionChoice
---
<<SyncAffinity>>
<<Scene "lounge bg draft 3">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>

// KITCHEN bg
// ONLY DADS WITH HIGH RELATIONSHIP point

Aelius: [Positive] Who to talk to with first...
-> Zeus <<if $zeusAffinity >= 28>>
    <<jump Ending_Zeus>>
-> Hermes <<if $hermesAffinity >= 29>>
    <<jump Ending_Hermes>>
-> Hephaestus <<if $hephaestusAffinity >= 29>>
    <<jump Ending_Hephaestus>>
-> Hestia
    <<jump Ending_Hestia>>
