title: Ending_Zeus
---
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>

<<if $talkedToZeusEnding is false>>
    <<set $talkedToZeusEnding = true>>

    Zeus: Good to see you, Aelius.
    Aelius: Likewide.
    Zeus: It's a big day. Do you think you're ready?
    Aelius: I guess I have to be, right?
    Zeus: Yes...It would be quite uncouth of Hestia to gather us all here only for you to lose your nerve.
    Aelius: ... Yeah, that would really suck for <i>you</i>.
    Zeus: Quite.
<<else>>
    Zeus: Hello again.
<<endif>>

-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’d like for you to come, if you’re up for it.
    Zeus: Oh, I would be more than happy to accompany you, Aelius.
    Aelius: Thanks Big Z.
    Zeus: Hm… Big Z… I like that.
    Zeus: I may have the other gods refer to me as such…
    Zeus: Well! We should be on our way, yes?
    Aelius: Yes. Let us be off, Big Z.
    <<set $choseZeusEnding = true>>
    <<jump Ending_GroupGoodbye>>
-> I’m gonna go see what Hermes is up to. <<if $hermesAffinity >= 29>>
    Zeus: Of course.
    <<jump Ending_Hermes>>
-> I should talk to Hephaestus before I go. <<if $hephaestusAffinity >= 29>>
    Zeus: Of course.
    <<jump Ending_Hephaestus>>
-> I'm gonna chat with Hestia.
    Zeus: Of course.
    <<jump Ending_Hestia>>
===
title: Ending_Hermes
---
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "lounge bg draft 3">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hermes" "Hermes 3_4" right bottom #00ffff>>

<<if $talkedToHermesEnding is false>>
    <<set $talkedToHermesEnding = true>>

    Hermes: [Positive] Hey kid, how ya feeling?
    Aelius: [Positive] Good. Really good, actually.
    Aelius: [Negative] I honestly never thought I’d get to see her again.
    Hermes: [Neutral] Fate has a way of delivering things to us, I’d say.
    Hermes: [Positive] I’m happy for you, though.
    Hermes: [Positive] You deserve this.
    Aelius: [Positive] Thanks, Hermes. I just still can’t believe it.
    Hermes: [Wink] Well, better start believing.
<<else>>
    Hermes: [Positive] Hm? Yeah?
<<endif>>

-> Aelius: [Positive] Hermes, I’d like you to go with me.
    Hermes: [Wink] Lil ole’ me?
    Hermes: [Positive] I’d be happy to go with you.
    Hermes: [Wink] Plus, I got a few tips and tricks for navigating.
    Aelius: [Smirk] I’m sure those will come in handy.
    Aelius: [Positive] Let’s start getting ready then, I suppose.
    Hermes: [Positive] Good idea, it’s quite the trek.
    <<set $choseHermesEnding = true>>
    <<jump Ending_GroupGoodbye>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’m gonna go talk with Zeus. <<if $zeusAffinity >= 28>>
    Hermes: [Positive] Alright kid, I’ll be here if you need me.
    <<jump Ending_Zeus>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’m gonna go check in with Hephaestus. <<if $hephaestusAffinity >= 29>>
    Hermes: [Positive] Alright kid, I’ll be here if you need me.
    <<jump Ending_Hephaestus>>
-> Aelius: [Neutral] I’m gonna chat with Hestia.
    Hermes: [Positive] Alright kid, I’ll be here if you need me.
    <<jump Ending_Hestia>>
===
title: Ending_Hephaestus
---
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "lounge bg draft 3">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" right bottom #cc0000>>

<<if $talkedToHephaestusEnding is false>>
