    Hephaestus: [Pos] Aelius…
    Aelius: [Pos] Hey, Hephaestus.
    Hephaestus: [Pos] I’m glad I got the chance to be here to see you off.
    Aelius: [Pos] Of course, there's no way I wouldn’t want you here for it.
    Hephaestus: [Pos] Thank you, Aelius. That means a lot.
<<else>>
    Hephaestus: [Pos] Hello again, Aelius.
<<endif>>

-> Aelius: [Pos] In fact, Hephaestus, I’d like you to come with me.
    Hephaestus: [Neu] You’re sure?
    Aelius: [Pos] Of course I am.
    Hephaestus: [Pos] Thank you, I’d like nothing more.
    <<set $choseHephaestusEnding = true>>
    <<jump Ending_GroupGoodbye>>
