title: Ending_GroupGoodbye
---
<<HideAll>>
<<Scene "lounge bg draft 3">>

<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" left bottom #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hestia" "Hestia 3_4s" right bottom #3d85c6>>

Hestia: [Neutral] Are you ready to go, my dear?
Aelius: [Neutral] Yeah… yeah, I think so.
Hestia: [Neutral] The others came to wish you well before you left.

Aphrodite: [Positive] Good luck, my dear. Enjoy your time with her.
Ares: [Positive] A worthy journey to take. Have a good time, Aelius.
Hera: [Positive] I’m happy for you, Aelius. Tell your mother she should be proud of the young adult she raised.

<<if $choseZeusEnding is false>>
Zeus: [Positive] AELIUS! HAVE A GOOD TRIP! SAY HI TO HER FOR ME!!
<<endif>>

<<if $choseHermesEnding is false>>
Hermes: [Positive] See you when you get back, kid. Give your mom my regards, she’s been fun to chat with.
<<endif>>

<<if $choseHephaestusEnding is false>>
Hephaestus: [Positive] Enjoy yourself, Aelius. I know this means a lot to you.
<<endif>>

<<if $choseHestiaEnding is true>>
    Hestia: [Positive] We best get going, we have quite the trip ahead of us.
    <<jump Ending_HestiaRoute>>
<<else>>
    Hestia: [Positive] Off you two go!
    Hestia: [Positive] I’ll see you back when you’re done, Aelius. Take all the time you need.

    <<if $choseZeusEnding is true>>
        <<jump Ending_ZeusRoute>>
    <<elseif $choseHermesEnding is true>>
        <<jump Ending_HermesRoute>>
    <<elseif $choseHephaestusEnding is true>>
        <<jump Ending_HephaestusRoute>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump Ending_HestiaRoute>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
